certain new school and find a nice girl to marry. It's a little unromantic, but perfectly do-able, right? After all, all the girls seem quite friendly, so all Shougo has to do is find one he has something in common with. EXCEPT, and here's the kicker, it turns out that Shougo has WAY too much in common with one of them, because she's actually his long lost sister! And he has no idea which one she is! Will Shougo meet and court his Miss Right without committing something very morally wrong? Can he find his future bride without slipping into the wrong set of genes? And if his little sister does reveal herself, just how much will be revealed and under what circumstances?\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Harem","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Incest","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swimming","rank":42,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"NAKAIMO - My Little Sister Is Among Them!","english":"NAKAIMO - My Little Sister Is Among Them!","native":"この中に1人, 妹がいる！","romaji":"Kono Naka ni Hitori, Imouto ga Iru!","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"この中に1人、妹がいる!"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"三人行必有我妹"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Nakaimo: My Little Sister Is Among Them!"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"我们中出了一个妹妹"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"其中1个是妹妹"}]},"trailer":{"id":"VECze5u2K6w","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VECze5u2K6w/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}